  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "This serves 6 and takes about 3 hours 30 minutes in total. The key thing to watch is the crust: every time a golden breadcrumb crust forms on top, you push it down into the beans so it forms again. Do this 3 or 4 times for maximum depth of flavour."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Brown every piece of meat separately and do not rush it. This is where the flavour base of the whole dish is built. Pale, under-browned meat produces a flat, thin cassoulet."
          }
        ]
      },
